Use io.

Define function divide_integers taking dividend as a whole number, divisor as a whole number returning a whole number:
    If dividend equals -2147483648 and divisor equals -1:
        Give back 2147483647.
    Let negative be false.
    Let top be dividend.
    Let bottom be divisor.
    If top is negative:
        Set negative to true.
        Set top to 0 - top.
    If bottom is negative:
        Set negative to true.
        Set bottom to 0 - bottom.
    Let quotient start at 0.
    Repeat while top is at least bottom:
        Subtract bottom from top.
        Add 1 to quotient.
    If negative:
        Give back 0 - quotient.
    Give back quotient.
Done.

Say divide_integers(10, 3).
Say divide_integers(7, -3).
Say divide_integers(-2147483648, -1).
Return 0.
